# HP40gs stock launch through the original APLET UI and USB disk.
# HP40gs 2.22 RECEIVE FROM order:
#   HP39/40 (USB), HP39/40 (Ser), USB Disk drive, Ser. Disk drive.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
13000 tap home
15000 tap aplet
16000 capture aplet-library
17000 tap f5
18000 capture receive-menu
18500 tap down
19200 tap down
19500 capture receive-usb-disk
19900 tap enter

40000 capture remote-aplet
41500 tap enter
43000 capture lazy-fetch
44000 host-gate

0 monitor 90000
500 capture fetch-complete
1000 retry enter
11000 retry enter
21000 retry enter
31000 retry enter
46000 retry enter
61000 retry enter
